                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The Lego Movie Videogame is a awesome, Lego game. HAHA, GET IT, AWESOME??? HA!!!! \r\nThis game is okay alone, but like most Lego games, it is better with a pal. I was able to share the joy of this game, with one of my good buddies. He liked it, and we both 100%'ed game together. \r\nThe Lego Movie Videogame is a meh game to 100%. There is 5 Minikits per level, and there is 16 levels. The game isnt too bad to go back and do, but it feels too short to do without it being a little annoying.\r\n\r\nBut, I really really do love this game, and I am glad i was able to share this with a friend. Thank you TT for such a good game, why did you mess up the 2nd one tho. :(",
